---
// Studio Being built: the build requests sent from the Figma plugin (a change that needs code: a new variant, option or
// layout) and where each one stands, read from GitHub only. Developers pick them up in GitHub or Jira; Bridge never
// writes to them. The list, its filters and the detail in place (?request=N, ?pull=N) are one island
// (components/ds/studio/BeingBuilt), reading through scripts/building-data.ts. Rules: lib/building-view.ts and
// docs/BUILD-REQUESTS.md. Team shell: pages/team-shell/building.astro.
// Claude's fixes (the fix sessions of the team's Claude through the Bridge connector, docs/FIGMA-FIXES.md "Work in
// progress") are rows of the same list, not a section of their own. On top, for whoever may publish it, the next
// release with "Review and publish" (components/NextRelease.astro): built, then released.
import '../../styles/studio-home.css';
import '../../styles/branch-thumb.css';
import '../../styles/building.css';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StudioHeader from '../../components/StudioHeader.astro';
import BeingBuilt from '../../components/ds/studio/BeingBuilt';
import NextRelease from '../../components/NextRelease.astro';
import { lastUpdated } from '../../lib/repo';

const sources = ['docs/BUILD-REQUESTS.md', 'docs/REQUESTS.md'];
---

<Layout
  title="Being built"
  description="The explorations handed to developers and the changes sent from Figma or from Components that developers are building, where each one stands until it is in the library, and the next release to publish."
  sources={sources}
  updated={lastUpdated(sources)}
  wide
>
  <StudioHeader title="Being built" scene="building">
    <Fragment slot="how">
      <p>Explorations handed to developers, and changes from Figma or from Components that need code, land here. Developers pick them up in GitHub or Jira; each one reads Shipped once it is in the library.</p>
      <p>Claude's fixes from Figma show here too: someone on your team reviews each one.</p>
    </Fragment>
  </StudioHeader>
  <NextRelease />
  <BeingBuilt client:only="react" />
</Layout>
